    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891570/extras/9f7e28d1593d605b8806a490a0e2b82c.avif?t=1744784329\" width=568 height=320 /></span><br><br><strong>&quot;Safety Corp.&quot;</strong> is a VR action game with realistic weapon mechanics, physics, and puzzle elements. You, as a technician, find yourself in the heart of an uprising at the Safety Corp. factory where crash-test dummies gained consciousness after a software update. In a world full of intricate puzzles and technical challenges, your goal is not only to restore order but also understand this unforeseen rebellion. Can you aid the dummies in their fight for freedom, or will you revert things back to normal? The choice is yours in this immersive VR journey. Brace yourself for the uprising - in Safety Corp., nothing will ever be the same again.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Original campaign</strong> with compelling characters and a protagonist that will keep you engaged<br></li><li> The end-game includes multiplayer <strong>PvP</strong> and <strong>PvE arenas</strong>, (<i>Rough-like</i> + <i>Dungeon Generation</i>) and an additional game mode: <strong>Infinite Arena</strong>.<br></li><li> Realistic handling of <strong>various weapons</strong>, where installed accessories have an impact on the weapon's behavior and recoil depends on factors like single or two-handed operation, mass, installed grips, and tuning<br></li><li> <strong>Weapon mechanics and physics</strong> are tested and approved by practical shooters and tactical instructors, making them realistic and accurate<br></li><li> Endless possibilities for tuning with a variety of <strong>skins</strong> and <strong>accessories</strong><br></li><li> Built-in <strong>level editor</strong> with &quot;programmable&quot; props and a community sharing feature, which allows users to create their own game modes</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891570/extras/3e45a87cdba1e155dac9582e5716a515.poster.avif?t=1744784329\" width=620 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891570/extras/3e45a87cdba1e155dac9582e5716a515.webm?t=1744784329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891570/extras/3e45a87cdba1e155dac9582e5716a515.mp4?t=1744784329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891570/extras/00a3e8964ef417e4e711c163870c8ae2.poster.avif?t=1744784329\" width=620 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891570/extras/00a3e8964ef417e4e711c163870c8ae2.webm?t=1744784329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891570/extras/00a3e8964ef417e4e711c163870c8ae2.mp4?t=1744784329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891570/extras/9f7e28d1593d605b8806a490a0e2b82c.avif?t=1744784329\" width=568 height=320 /></span><br><br><strong>&quot;Safety Corp.&quot;</strong> is a VR action game with realistic weapon mechanics, physics, and puzzle elements. You, as a technician, find yourself in the heart of an uprising at the Safety Corp. factory where crash-test dummies gained consciousness after a software update. In a world full of intricate puzzles and technical challenges, your goal is not only to restore order but also understand this unforeseen rebellion. Can you aid the dummies in their fight for freedom, or will you revert things back to normal? The choice is yours in this immersive VR journey. Brace yourself for the uprising - in Safety Corp., nothing will ever be the same again.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Original campaign</strong> with compelling characters and a protagonist that will keep you engaged<br></li><li> The end-game includes multiplayer <strong>PvP</strong> and <strong>PvE arenas</strong>, (<i>Rough-like</i> + <i>Dungeon Generation</i>) and an additional game mode: <strong>Infinite Arena</strong>.<br></li><li> Realistic handling of <strong>various weapons</strong>, where installed accessories have an impact on the weapon's behavior and recoil depends on factors like single or two-handed operation, mass, installed grips, and tuning<br></li><li> <strong>Weapon mechanics and physics</strong> are tested and approved by practical shooters and tactical instructors, making them realistic and accurate<br></li><li> Endless possibilities for tuning with a variety of <strong>skins</strong> and <strong>accessories</strong><br></li><li> Built-in <strong>level editor</strong> with &quot;programmable&quot; props and a community sharing feature, which allows users to create their own game modes</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891570/extras/3e45a87cdba1e155dac9582e5716a515.poster.avif?t=1744784329\" width=620 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891570/extras/3e45a87cdba1e155dac9582e5716a515.webm?t=1744784329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891570/extras/3e45a87cdba1e155dac9582e5716a515.mp4?t=1744784329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891570/extras/00a3e8964ef417e4e711c163870c8ae2.poster.avif?t=1744784329\" width=620 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891570/extras/00a3e8964ef417e4e711c163870c8ae2.webm?t=1744784329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891570/extras/00a3e8964ef417e4e711c163870c8ae2.mp4?t=1744784329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
